# Boiling Rock Rioter: "you may cast an Ally spell from among cards you own exiled with this creature". Bot2's Gran-Gran (an Ally) dies to Bot1's
# Lightning Bolt on turn 3 and the Rioter exiles it, tapping Earth Kingdom Protectors. On turn 5 Bot1's own Bolt is exiled the same way. When the Rioter
# attacks, with {U} (Mox Sapphire) and {R} (Mountain) both untapped, neither card is offered: Gran-Gran is an Ally but Bot2 owns it, the Bolt is Bot1's
# but is not an Ally spell. Nothing is asked, both cards stay in exile, and the firebending {R} is still added.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Boiling Rock Rioter
Earth Kingdom Protectors
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Gran-Gran
Island x20

